export const P2_FAQS: [string,string][] = [["Is Entra ID P2 included in Microsoft 365 E5?","Yes. Microsoft 365 E5 and EMS E5 include Entra ID P2, so those users don't need a separate licence. If you're on Business Premium or E3 (which include P1), buy P2 standalone for the users who need it."],["Who in my organisation needs a P2 licence?","Users covered by risk-based policies, anyone eligible for or approving PIM roles, and every reviewer and reviewed user in access reviews. Many companies licence P2 for admins and high-risk teams (finance, leadership) and keep P1 for everyone else."],["Can I mix P1 and P2 users in the same tenant?","Yes. Licences are assigned per user, so you can run P1 and P2 side by side and move users up as needs change. We help you scope policies to licensed users only."],["What does risk-based Conditional Access actually do?","ID Protection assigns a risk level to each sign-in and each user. Your policies then act on it — for example, ask for MFA when sign-in risk is medium or high, and require a secure password change when user risk is high. Users fix most issues themselves, so the help desk isn't flooded."],["How does PIM reduce risk?","Instead of permanent admin rights, people are made eligible for roles. They activate a role only when needed, for a limited time, with MFA, a justification and (if you choose) approval. Every activation is logged and roles expire on their own — so a stolen admin password is worth far less."],["Do I also need Entra ID Governance?","Not to start. P2 covers core access reviews and entitlement management. Add ID Governance when you want HR-driven lifecycle workflows, automatic access assignment by attributes, or machine-learning suggestions in reviews."],["What's the difference between monthly and yearly billing?","Monthly is billed each month per seat at ₹755. Yearly is ₹8,765 per seat paid upfront for 12 months — the lowest per-seat price. Both are exclusive of 18% GST and below Microsoft's list price."],["Can XcellHost set up PIM and risk policies for us?","Yes. We review your tenant, design risk and PIM policies, test them on a pilot group, roll out in stages and train your admins. Ask for the \"PIM & risk policy setup\" consultation in the callback form."],["Do I get a GST invoice?","Yes — every order comes with a GST-compliant invoice from XcellHost Cloud Services Pvt. Ltd. Pay by UPI, card, net banking or bank transfer."]];
